&lt;tr style="height:40.5pt;min-height:40.5pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;希薄化効果を有しないため、潜在株式調整後1株当たり当期純利益の算定に含めなかった潜在株式の概要&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:bottom;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="bottom"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐゴシック&amp;apos;;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
