  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingGuaranteeObligationForCorporateBondsIncludedInAssetsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;"&gt;※９　「有価証券」中の社債のうち、有価証券の私募(金融商品取引法第2条第3項)による社債に対する保証債務の額&lt;/p&gt;
